{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate gravity, walk on walls, and uncover secrets in this atmospheric dungeon puzzler where every room offers a completely unique idea. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAWL ON THE WALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flex your spatial reasoning skills as you walk on the walls in order to delve deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/1.gif?t=1745611818\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIRE YOUR ARROW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your bow is the primary tool at your disposal, however you've got just one arrow. Recall the arrow from anywhere to retrieve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/2.gif?t=1745611818\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO FILLER CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each puzzle offers a completely unique idea, carefully designed to surprise and delight you as the core set of mechanics goes deeper and deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/3.gif?t=1745611818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1070500?t=1745611818","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1070500?t=1745611818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745611818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745611818","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"app